flowchart LR
    accTitle: The grounding interaction
    accDescr: Working information informs a grounding procedure. The procedure sends an external action into an environment. Feedback, when available, is processed into an observation represented in working memory.

    WM[Working information] --> GP[Grounding procedure]
    GP -->|sends| ACTION[External action]
    ACTION --> ENV[External environment]
    ENV -->|feedback, if available| GP
    GP -->|processes and represents| OBS[Observation]
    OBS --> WM2[Working memory]

    classDef store fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef process fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    classDef external fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px;
    class WM,WM2,OBS store;
    class GP process;
    class ACTION,ENV external;
